guage input.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Smart Refund & Exchange Engine",\n      "description": "AI-driven eligibility checks for refunds/exchanges, easy rescheduling for travel and event tickets.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "AR/VR Event Preview & Simulation",\n      "description": "AR seat view, event layout exploration, and VR for virtual attendance at hybrid/online events.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Emotion-Based Recommendation Engine",\n      "description": "Sentiment analysis from reviews/social/mood tracking to suggest experiences based on emotional trends.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Dynamic Surge Pricing & Transparency",\n      "description": "Demand-based pricing with real-time graphs, past trends, and predictive pricing alerts.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Developer & Partner API Hub",\n      "description": "REST/GraphQL APIs for third-party vendors to push inventory, access reports, and manage payments.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Smart Waitlist & Drop Alerts",\n      "description": "Notify users when tickets become available, better seats open up, and enable one-tap quick booking for reclaimed spots.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4696d2",\n    "secondary": "#F9AB00",\n    "accent": "#34A853"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a universal search bar at the top, with domain tabs (Sports, Movies, Travel, Events, etc.) below. Personalized recommendations and dynamic event carousels are displayed on the home screen. Booking flows use interactive seat maps (with AR/VR preview), and a floating AI assistant/chatbot is accessible throughout. Admin/vendor 